\label{scaleinv2}

If $x_k=(p,0)$ in the $k$th rescaled flow, then
\[
 \widetilde V_{x_k}(\tau)=\widetilde V_x(\bar\tau_k\tau).
\]
\end{claim}
\begin{proof}
\sketch This is the reduced-volume reparameterization formula,
Lemma~\ref{Qformula}.
\end{proof}

\begin{corollary}[Reduced volume limit is constant]

